    "d2f3e665-9bf4-4aee-8b67-425b66d670c6": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "75f8a537-55ac-4222-9783-a4fd0477d5b9": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "1. WE ARE ALL ONE",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Our LifeLine journey begins with end in mind. You will learn a daily practice for creating present time consciousness so you can manifest optimal health and meaningful relationships all through the 4 steps of setting an intention. I will show you how to raise the consciousness of your body and relationships.  As a result of evolving your own consciousness, you'll be contributing with raising the consciousness of humanity.<\/p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": false,
            "background_color": "#e1e8ff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "4c239ee9-479d-4f81-b5b6-a7c9750699a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "2. RETURN TO NATURE",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Mother Nature is your nature. Through a simple process adapted from the Five Element Theory of Chinese Medicine, you are able to harmonize the dormant life force of nature living within you.  As a direct result – like a river flowing towards the ocean – your emotional channels naturally begin to flow with inner peace and freedom.<\/p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#e1e8ff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "0a6fb51b-ba50-461a-992b-45e0e72261a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "3. AWAKENING GRATITUDE",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Your body, behavior, and relationships are a direct reflection of your mind. Change your mindset and you directly and positively impact the health of your life on all levels. Symptoms, stress, and disease are gifts in strange wrapping paper.  Through gratitude we evolve subconscious reactive patterns into a meaningful dialogue.<\/p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#e1e8ff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "d5af11b3-e1d0-4ae7-aef9-b21af820cfff": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "4. REMEMBER WHAT YOU'VE BEEN PROGRAMED TO FORGET",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Transforming limiting beliefs, processing body memory, and trauma holding patterns will empower you to create new neural chemistry and pathways. Post-traumatic stress evolves into post traumatic growth.<\/p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#e1e8ff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "d2c67790-d1b5-4bce-8784-42372bc6dc67": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "5. CHOOSING LOVE",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>It’s now time to water the garden of the heart seeds you’ve planted. As a result of this evolutionary journey of awakening your spirit, you will notice deeper states of peace and confidence, commitment and patience within you. You will notice a change from surviving to thriving and clarity when it comes to creating healthy boundaries and making important decisions in your life.<\/p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#e1e8ff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
