          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>As you heal your own life, you become a light in the world of others<\/strong><\/p><p>Have you ever noticed how some people are stuck in patterns of emotional and physical pain, loss and trauma and don’t know what to do to move forward?<\/p><p>This course is for people who are seeking deep healing and personal transformation.<\/p>"
